; Lifecycle scripts are disabled in this repository.
;
; Everything in package.json is development-only (the local hot-reload server in
; src/server.js). Nothing in package.json ships inside dist/borderwallets.html.
;
; The machine that runs `npm install` here is also the machine that builds and
; PGP-signs releases, so third-party install scripts are not permitted to run.
; See DEPENDENCIES.md ("Release build integrity").
ignore-scripts=true
